ll=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Suchitepéquez</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Quetzaltenango</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Huehuetenango</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Quiché</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Alta Verapaz</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> El Progreso</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg> Jutiapa</span>\n<span class=\"da-chip\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-7.2 7-12a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 12 7 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4